# Mobile backend

All mobile API code lives in **`mobile_backend/`** at project root.

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `mobile_backend/` | `/api/v1/*` routes, services, JWT auth, SQL |
| `addons/mobile_api/` | Thin addon stub (manifest only) |
| `D:\webapps\Nexa_Mobile_FastAPI\flutter_app` | Flutter UI (separate folder) |

## Database

Auth tables → `_get_connection_auth()`; ERP tables → tenant DB from JWT `tenant_id`.

Use `mobile_backend/database/oracle_pool.py` — do not add a second Oracle pool.

## New routes

1. Service under `mobile_backend/services/`
2. Router under `mobile_backend/routes/` with prefix `/api/v1/...`
3. Register in `mobile_backend/__init__.py`
4. `require_access_claims` + permission deps; return `success()` / `failure()`

## Stock count POST

Delegate to `addons/warehouse/stock_count_db.post_stock_count_to_inventory()` for full GL/stock update.
